      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRESSER (5) gets the nod on his stronger overall profile, with the Caulfield third two starts ago showing he can be highly competitive around this level when right. The ninth last start was plain, but he's third-up, has won at this track and distance and gets a lovely weight swing on LIM'S SALTORO (1). He does bring the best recent black-type form after thirds in the Listed Seymour Cup and Listed Testa Rossa Stakes and blinkers on from a good draw suggest intent. WONDER BOY (2) has been well held in two runs back, yet this is easier than the Listed Weekend Hussler Stakes and he is already a track-and-trip winner with Jamie Mott returning. RESET THE JAZZ (6) has to lift from Coonamble, but his third in a BM84 at this track two back reads well enough for a placing.  AZTEC RULER (3) is a minor hope but struggles to win.",
